---
title: "Connect GitHub, one run: create the app, install it, get a token"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Create the app
    lg1: Install the app
    lg2: Connected
    lg3: Cancelled
    lg4: Stuck
    lg5: Breaks NoDeadEnd
    lg6: Path to the NoDeadEnd bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 purple
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 tan
  class lg4 orange
  class lg5 breaks
  class lg6 bugPath
  state "Connecting GitHub" as s0 {
    s1: Not started
    s2: Waiting for you to create the app on GitHub
    s3: Ceremony is unsure whether your app exists
    s4: Ceremony is fetching your new app from GitHub
    s5: App ready
    s6: Stuck: only Cancel is left
    s7: Waiting for you to install the app on GitHub
    s8: App installed
    [*] --> s1
  }
  s9: Cancelled
  s10: Connected: token stored
  [*] --> s0
  s1 --> s1: Ceremony starts the app step
  s1 --> s2: Ceremony prepares the GitHub hand-off
  s2 --> s2: you open the hand-off page or the page sends you to GitHub
  s2 --> s3: the hand-off expires [after you opened the GitHub page]
  s2 --> s4: you create the app on GitHub and GitHub sends you back
  s4 --> s4: Ceremony uses up the one-time return link or GitHub hands over the app and Ceremony stores it
  s4 --> s3: GitHub does not answer
  s3 --> s2: you start a new registration [when Ceremony holds no app]
  s4 --> s5: GitHub confirms the app
  s5 --> s5: Ceremony starts the app step
  s5 --> s6: GitHub does not answer when Ceremony checks the app
  s3 --> s5: Ceremony confirms the app with GitHub [when it already holds the app] or you enter the app's ID and private key on the recovery page
  s5 --> s7: Ceremony prepares the install hand-off
  s7 --> s8: you install the app and GitHub sends you back
  s8 --> s10: Ceremony checks the installation and stores a token
  s0 --> s9: you cancel
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 blue
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 blue
  class s4 blue
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 purple
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 orange
  class s6 breaks
  class s6 bugPath
  class s7 purple
  class s8 purple
  class s9 tan
  class s10 teal
